+// ===== Test 22: Scatter with sharding constraints and a broadcast zero bound =====
+// Mirrors what JAX explicit sharding mode emits for
+// x.at[jnp.arange(B), idx].add(updates): the zero bound of the negative-index
+// select is a scalar constant that is broadcast and then constrained.
